 clout, and by the way, Xi Jinping of China has to see what's happening and say, wow, look at that. That's not just America pushing back on Russia for their Ukraine invasion. It's all of the European Union and these major allies of America, which could together represent over half the economy of the world And if we China want to keep selling products to the economy of the world, we better watch this carefully and not take action, which would cause them to do the same",
